set to restore the formula multiple. Changing the window can change both its growth calculation and reference line.</p><p><a href="/methodology/">Read the exact CAGR and reference-multiple formulas.</a> Missing or non-positive annual observations leave gaps in the reference line. A stock trading below it is not, by itself, evidence that the stock is undervalued.</p><h2>Respect the historical dates</h2><p>The chart uses retrospective information, including stored restated annual facts. It is not a point-in-time backtest, forecast, intrinsic-value calculation, or live quote service. Compare the displayed price date with the latest fiscal period before drawing conclusions.</p><p><a href="/guides/eps-vs-free-cash-flow-per-share/">Compare earnings with free cash flow per share</a> or <a href="/guides/export-stock-history-csv/">export the selected chart data</a>.</p>${credit}`],
